code it modifies (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). The image build applies it on top of TensorFold at the pinned commit.

The checkpoint this recipe serves, Minachist/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-INT4-Mixed-AutoRound, is a quantization of
Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next and carries the Qwen Community License; the recipe downloads it from Hugging Face and
converts it locally, it does not redistribute weights.

The quality suite downloads two public datasets at run time, each pinned to a commit: GSM8K's test split
(openai/grade-school-math, MIT) and IFEval's prompts (google-research/google-research, Apache License 2.0).
